WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:08.425
Telo Ride 1 has no account. Open it, and it asks for nothing: no email, no code, no

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:09.077
name.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.051
Nothing is earned. The header lost its streak, its level and its XP bar, and

00:00:15.051 --> 00:00:18.543
Profile keeps two rows: the bike, and ride settings.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:28.501
Nothing is recorded. Finish the class, and Results shows your time, with no XP. The

00:00:28.501 --> 00:00:31.500
ride is sent nowhere, and no cookie is set.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.166
Feedback and the custom workout left with the account. The backend keeps the class

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:44.719
catalogue, and one migration drops every rider table.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.962
Home, with nothing to sign in to, on every screen from a phone to a desktop.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:04.369
What the tests prove: no sign-in, no request but the catalogue, every class open,

00:01:04.369 --> 00:01:06.462
and every check still passes.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:17.920
Telo Ride 1, from the Telo family, is the focused edition of Telo Ride: one class,

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.116
nothing else.

00:01:19.461 --> 00:01:24.413
It pairs with a smart bike at home over Bluetooth, plays the class video, or draws

00:01:24.413 --> 00:01:29.425
the Ibiza Sunset Strip course to music if the rider chooses it, and sets the bike's

00:01:29.425 --> 00:01:32.926
resistance for every interval while the rider pedals.

00:01:33.272 --> 00:01:37.247
Connect the bike, take the class, see your number, and come back to beat it.
